# Local Claude Code MCP config. Machine-specific by nature — it names an
# absolute interpreter path and checkpoint directory — so it must not ship.
# Anyone who clones the repo and opens it in Claude Code would otherwise have
# this fire with another machine's paths, fail to launch, and get the silent
# "plugin present, no tools" symptom. Install the plugin instead; the plugin's
# own .mcp.json resolves its paths from user config.
.mcp.json
